  "description": "SEC-0006 embedded OAuth 2.1 Authorization Server for Koan: the MCP auth on-ramp. Mints asymmetric (ES256) access tokens for OAuth clients via Authorization Code + PKCE and the Device Authorization Grant, advertises itself per the MCP authorization spec, and reuses the trust fabric for issuance. Opt-in leaf (Reference = Intent).",
